# Design Context

Before any UI or design work on this project, read:

- `PRODUCT.md` — register, users, brand personality, anti-references, design principles
- `DESIGN.md` — visual tokens, typography, components, do's and don'ts

**Register:** product (kids memory game UI)
**North Star:** "The Encouraging Playroom"
**Stack:** Single-file `index.html`, Tailwind CDN, canvas game engine

Use `/impeccable <command>` for design tasks (critique, polish, live, etc.).
